    <ferc:ExplanatoryOfSecuritiesIssuedOrAssumedAndSecuritiesRefundedOrRetiredTextBlock id="f-3942" contextRef="c-52">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"&gt;Senior Notes. In June 2025, Florida Gas retired its $500 million aggregate principal amount of 4.35% senior notes due in July 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Senior Notes. In June 2025, Florida Gas issued $800 million aggregate principal amount of its 5.75% senior notes due in July 2035.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:ExplanatoryOfSecuritiesIssuedOrAssumedAndSecuritiesRefundedOrRetiredTextBlock>
