"126" style="width: 94.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 14.85pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;Customer B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="45" style="width: 33.6pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 14.85pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="141" valign="bottom" style="width: 105.9pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 14.85pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;12,201 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="bottom" style="width: 13.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 14.85pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="136" style="width: 102.2pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 14.85pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;11,949   &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt;&lt;p align="left" style="margin: 0; line-height: 12pt; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: left; text-indent: 0.5in"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.1in; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Florida Gas has a concentration of customers located in the southeastern United States, primarily within the state of Florida.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Receivables are generally not collateralized. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;From time to time, specifically identified customers having perceived credit risk are required to provide prepayments, deposits, or other forms of security to Florida Gas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Florida Gas had Customer deposits, Account 235, totaling $16.4 million and $16.2 million as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Florida Gas had Customer advances, Account 252, of $60.5 million and $56.3 million as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Florida Gas' management believes that the portfolio of Florida Gas' receivables, which includes regulated electric utilities, regulated local distribution companies and municipalities, is of minimal credit risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt; 16. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration-line: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Fair Value Measurement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 4.5pt; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.1in; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Under Accounting Standards Codification (&amp;quot;ASC&amp;quot;) Topic 820, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;i style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Fair Value Measurement&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;, the fair value measurements are characterized in one of three levels based upon the input used to arrive at the measurement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The three levels of the fair value hierarchy are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 30.6pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;li style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Level 1 inputs are quoted prices (unadjusted) in active markets for identical assets or liabilities that the reporting entity can access at the measurement date;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 30.6pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;li style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Level 2 inputs are inputs other than quoted prices included within Level 1 that are observable for the asset or liability, either directly or indirectly; and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 30.6pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;li style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Level 3 inputs are unobservable inputs for the asset or liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p align="left" style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; text-indent: 0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.1in; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Assets and liabilities are classified in their entirety based on the lowest level of input that is significant to the fair value measurement. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Florida Gas' assessment of the significance of a particular input to the fair value measurement requires judgment and may affect the valuation of these assets and liabilities and their placement within the fair value hierarchy. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The carrying amounts of cash and cash equivalents, accounts receivable and accounts payable approximate their fair value. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The Other postretirement plan assets are classified as Level 1 assets within the fair-value hierarchy as their values are based on active market quotes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The fair value of Florida Gas' debt obligations is a Level 2 valuation based on observable inputs for the liabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt; 17. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration-line: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Retirement Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 4.5pt; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.1in; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Employers are required to recognize in their balance sheets the overfunded or underfunded status of defined benefit other postretirement plans, measured as the difference between the fair value of the plan assets and the benefit obligation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Each overfunded plan is recognized as an asset and each underfunded plan is recognized as a liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Employers applying regulatory accounting recognize the changes in the funded status of the plan as a regulatory asset or regulatory liability in the year in which the changes occur. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Florida Gas recognized net periodic benefit expense to the extent amounts are recovered in Florida Gas' rates with any difference recorded as a regulatory asset or regulatory liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Unrecognized prior service costs (benefits) and gains and/or losses are recorded as a regulatory asset or regulatory liability, reflecting amounts due from or to customers, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 4.5pt; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-weight: bold; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;b style="font-weight: bold; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt; 18.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.35in; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-weight: bold; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.1in; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Income taxes are accounted for under the asset and liability method. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Under this method, deferred tax assets and liabilities are recognized for the estimated future tax consequences attributable to differences between the financial statement carrying amounts of existing assets and liabilities and their respective tax basis. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Deferred tax assets and liabilities are measured using enacted tax rates in effect for the year in which those temporary differences are expected to be recovered or settled. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Under regulatory accounting, the effect on deferred tax assets and liabilities related to a change in tax rate is recognized as a regulatory asset or regulatory liability in the period that includes the enactment date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Valuation allowances are established when necessary to reduce deferred tax assets to the amounts more likely than not to be realized.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The determination of Florida Gas' provision for income taxes requires significant judgment, use of estimates, and the interpretation and application of complex tax laws. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Significant judgment is required in assessing the timing and amounts of deductible and taxable items.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Reserves are established when, despite management's belief that Florida Gas' tax return positions are fully supportable, management believes that certain positions may be successfully challenged.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;When facts and circumstances change, these reserves are adjusted through the provision for income taxes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.1in; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;b style="font-weight: bold; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt; 19.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;Taxes, Other Than on Income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.35in; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.1in; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Taxes, other than on income primarily consist of ad valorem tax paid on the assessed value of Florida Gas' natural gas transmission lines based on fixed rates established by the applicable state or local taxing authorities. Ad valorem taxes are generally based on assessed property value at the beginning of each year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;i style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt; 20. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration-line: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.35in; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 9pt; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Florida Gas is subject to proceedings, lawsuits and other claims related to environmental and other matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Accounting for contingencies requires significant judgment by management regarding the estimated probabilities and ranges of exposure to potential liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 -0.1in; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;NOTE C - RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0.1pt 0 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0.1pt 0 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-indent: 9.35pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The following table provides a summary of affiliate transactions for the periods presented:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-indent: 9.35pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="557" style="width: 599px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; max-width: 1631.65px; height: 238px" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 10.5042%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;   &lt;td width="291" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 52.2442%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 3.2316%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="230" colspan="3" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 41.2926%"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;Years Ended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 3.2316%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 10.5042%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;   &lt;td width="291" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 52.2442%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 3.2316%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="230" colspan="3" valign="bottom" style="border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 41.2926%"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 3.2316%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 10.9244%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;   &lt;td width="291" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 52.2442%"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; width: 3.2316%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="104" valign="bottom" style="border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; heigh