        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-4177_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-4177_47367_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-4216_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-4216_47408_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-119_46883_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b>Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 1 Column: a</b></span></span></p><p><span><span style="font-size: 12pt">Pursuant to Section 24 of the General Terms and Conditions of Florida Gas' FERC Gas Tariff, Fifth Revised Volume No. 1, Docket No. RP26-323-000.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-121_46884_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><div><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"><span><b>Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 2 Column: a</b></span></span></span></p></div><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit">Pursuant to Article VII, Section 7 of Stipulation and Agreement of Settlement, Docket No. RP21-441-000, et al. as approved by FERC's order issued on June 3, 2022.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-123_46876_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b>Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 3 Column: a</b></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span>In December 2017, the "Tax Cuts and Jobs Act" was signed into law.  Among other provisions, the highest corporate federal income tax rate was reduced from 35% to 21% for taxable years beginning after December 31, 2017.     Under regulatory accounting, the effect on deferred tax assets and liabilities of a change in tax rate is recognized as a regulatory asset or regulatory liability in the period that includes the enactment date. Docket No. PL19-2-000 dated November 15, 2018.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">Pursuant to Article VII, Section 2 of Stipulation and Agreement of Settlement, Docket No. RP21-441-000, et al. as approved by FERC's order issued </span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit">on June 3, 2022, Florida Gas adjusted regulatory liability at June 30, 2021, which resulted in an adjustment to its deferred income tax liability. </span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit">The amortization period is 38 years for Florida Gas Incremental FTS-3. The amortization period is 20 years for Florida Gas (excluding FTS-3).</span></span></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-147_46881_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span><b><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 4 Column: a</span></b></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">Pursuant to Section 24.A.4 of the General Terms and Conditions of Florida Gas' FERC Gas Tariff, Fifth Revised Volume No. 1, Docket No. RP26-323-000</span></span></span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; float: none; display: inline !important">.</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-341_46882_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource">Original value: N</link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-416_47189_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b>Schedule Page: 220 Line No.: 1 Column: e</b></span></p><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Florida Gas uses the fixed asset method to account for gas owed to the system. This footnote also applies to line 5, column (e).</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-432_46877_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>Schedule Page: 276 Line No.: 7 Column: b</b></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Estimated balances of deferred income taxes that could be included in the development of jurisdictional recourse rates at 1/1/2025:</span></span></p><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="840" class="e-rte-table-border e-rte-table" style="width: 630pt"> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" width="683" style="height: 15.75pt; width: 512pt; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">AFUDC  Equity Gross Up</span></span></td>  <td width="157" style="width: 118pt; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right" class=""><span> </span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">$</span></span><span>             </span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">31,581,690</span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 16.5pt">  <td height="22" style="height: 16.5pt; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-fami