        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2692_47237_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b>Schedule Page: 520 Line No.: 20 Column: c</b></span></p><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt">For the purpose of the Annual Charge Adjustment ("ACA") calculation, the throughput volume is 1,251,816,649 Dth as represented on line 20. No additional volumes are needed to calculate the volumes eligible for the ACA surcharge.</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2724_47238_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b>Schedule Page: 520 Line No.: 29.1 Column: d</b></span></p><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="840" class="e-rte-table-border e-rte-table e-rte-paste-html-table" style="font-family: sans-serif; width: 630pt"><tr style="height: 15.75pt"><td height="21" width="683" style="height: 15.75pt; width: 512pt; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif"><br /></td><td width="157" class="" style="width: 118pt; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: 700; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: right; text-indent: 0; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important">(<span style="text-decoration: underline">Dth</span>)</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 16.5pt"><td height="22" style="height: 16.5pt; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif">Other than compressor fuel</td><td style="padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-align: right">124,788</td></tr><tr style="height: 15.75pt"><td height="21" class="" style="height: 15.75pt; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif">Reported on page 521, line 22, column (e)</td><td style="padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right">124,788</td></tr><tr style="height: 16.5pt"><td height="22" style="height: 16.5pt; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif">Line pack</td><td style="padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-align: right">(49,261)</td></tr><tr style="height: 15.75pt"><td height="21" style="height: 15.75pt; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif">Reported on page 520, line 29, column (d)</td><td style="padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right">75,527</td></tr></table></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2771_47240_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: f</b></span></p><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The basis for valuing the gas reported in columns (f), (g) and (h) is based on the daily mid-point spot prices in Zones 1, 2 and 3 of Gas Daily as provided in the tariff.</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2899_47239_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: e</b></span></p><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The allocation is derived from the throughput volume of each contract within the billing system. A path to path calculation of the rate utilized within the contract billing is determined and a percentage for recourse rate, discount rate and negotiated rate is derived based on the rate charged within the paths. These percentages are used to record the rate structure on Form 2, page 521.</span></p><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt">This footnote also applies to column (e), lines 14, 22, 30, 37, 51 and 65.</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3620_47267_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b style="font-weight: bold; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 5 Column: a</b></span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br /></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Pursuant to Section 27.E of the General Terms and Conditions of Florida Gas' FERC Gas Tariff, Fifth Revised Volume No. 1, Docket No. RP24-1014-000, as approved by FERC's order issued on September 24, 2024, Docket No. RP25-631-000, as approved by FERC's order issued on March 20, 2025, and Docket No. RP25-1112-000, as approved by FERC's order issued on September 23, 2025.</span></span><br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3646_47271_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 234 Line No.: 5 Column: k</b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Estimated balances of deferred income taxes that could be included in the development of jurisdictional recourse rates at 12/31/2025:</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">None</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3825_47274_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 274 Line No.: 5 Column: k</b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Estimated balances of deferred income taxes that could be included in the development of jurisdictional recourse rates at 12/31/2025:</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Property, plant and equipment $891,861,360</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
