        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-4177_47367_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b style="font-weight: bold; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)">Schedule Page: 358 Line No.: 35 Column: b</b></span></span></p><p><img src="data:image/gif;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" width="877" height="172" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1580px; min-height: 0" alt="" /></p><p><br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-4216_47408_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><b style="font-weight: bold; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)">Schedule Page: 514 Line No.: 7 Column: e</b></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">The 16.7-mile reduction in the Florida Mainlines and Laterals consists of: (1) 8.4 miles of 6-inch and 8-inch pipelines retired at the book costs of $347,671, as approved by the FERC in Docket No. CP25-40; and (2) 8.3 miles of 6-inch pipelines retired at the book costs of $1,585,199, as approved by the FERC in Docket No. CP25-23.</span></span><br /></p></div></link:footnote>
